: "12191", "source_chars": 11683, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 1, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 0, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 0}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 0, "Arithmetic": 0, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 0}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.3, "Access Control": 0.35, "Arithmetic": 0.1, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.3, "DoS": 0.35, "Bad Randomness": 0.03, "Front Running": 0.75, "Time manipulation": 0.25}, "reasons": {"Front Running": "The internal tax swap calls swapExactTokensForETHSupportingFeeOnTransferTokens with amountOutMin = 0 and a block.timestamp deadline, and it triggers on a predictable threshold, so it can be sandwiched for profit."}, "agreement": 5, "wall_seconds": 22.64, "cli_duration_ms": 20632, "api_duration_ms": 20582, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 1569, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 6430, "cache_read_input_tokens": 8499, "total_tokens": 16502}, "cost_usd": 0.10779449999999999, "num_turns": 3, "session_id": "ef353b63-2def-4258-9298-a5f75b199a43"}, {"contractID": "13761", "source_chars": 10817, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 0, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 0}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 0, "Arithmetic": 0, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 0}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.95, "Access Control": 0.85, "Arithmetic": 0.9, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.93, "DoS": 0.92, "Bad Randomness": 0.97, "Front Running": 0.65, "Time manipulation": 0.96}, "reasons": {"Front Running": "The standard ERC20 `approve` overwrites the allowance directly, allowing the classic approve/transferFrom race where a spender front-runs an allowance change to spend both old and new amounts."}, "agreement": 6, "wall_seconds": 7.96, "cli_duration_ms": 6010, "api_duration_ms": 5950, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 446, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4571, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1690, "total_tokens": 6709}, "cost_usd": 0.057715, "num_turns": 2, "session_id": "4c3a66a7-b873-4fbc-a94f-4d7b0405db05"}, {"contractID": "13910", "source_chars": 10086, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 1, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 1, "Bad Randomness": 1, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 1}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 0, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 1, "DoS": 1, "Bad Randomness": 1, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 1}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.35, "Access Control": 0.25, "Arithmetic": 0.9, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.85, "DoS": 0.8, "Bad Randomness": 0.55, "Front Running": 0.7, "Time manipulation": 0.75}, "reasons": {"Arithmetic": "Solidity 0.4.19 with no SafeMath: `_endTime + now`, `price - oldPrice`, `a * 100` in ceil(), `totalAuction -= counter` and `totalModerators -= 1` can overflow/underflow, and the gene/price divisions truncate value-bearing math.", "Unchecked Return Values": "Return values of DTTtoken.approve() and the external DataBase/NFTToken calls are ignored in buy() and setNewMonster().", "DoS": "burnAuction() and monstersForSale() loop unbounded over totalAuction, sortAuction/quicksort recurses over an arbitrarily long array, and push-payment `oldOwner.transfer(oldPrice)` lets a rejecting owner block purchases.", "Bad Randomness": "randMod() derives randomness from keccak256(now, msg.sender, randNonce), both miner-influenceable and predictable.", "Front Running": "Auction purchases are ordered-dependent \u2014 observers can front-run a pending buy() to grab the monster, and the allowance+increase approve pattern is subject to the classic approve race.", "Time manipulation": "Auction validity (`endTime > now`) and burn eligibility (`endTime < now - 259200`) depend on block.timestamp, which miners can nudge."}, "agreement": 4, "wall_seconds": 23.66, "cli_duration_ms": 21827, "api_duration_ms": 21786, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 1751, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4803, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1690, "total_tokens": 8246}, "cost_usd": 0.09266, "num_turns": 2, "session_id": "b39f8932-0678-4a78-95af-4a9e6c132efe"}, {"contractID": "15871", "source_chars": 14865, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 0, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 0}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 0, "Arithmetic": 0, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 1, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 0}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.93, "Access Control": 0.75, "Arithmetic": 0.85, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.9, "DoS": 0.5, "Bad Randomness": 0.98, "Front Running": 0.5, "Time manipulation": 0.98}, "reasons": {"DoS": "bulkTransfer loops over an unbounded caller-supplied array and reverts entirely if any single _transfer fails, so oversized batches or one bad entry can exhaust gas/block the whole batch.", "Front Running": "Standard ERC20 approve() overwrites allowance without a zero-check, exposing the classic approve/transferFrom ordering race that a spender can exploit."}, "agreement": 5, "wall_seconds": 14.71, "cli_duration_ms": 12725, "api_duration_ms": 12662, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 742, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 6325, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1690, "total_tokens": 8759}, "cost_usd": 0.082655, "num_turns": 2, "session_id": "e810d61d-8654-4d79-bee8-fe3398fcc0bc"}, {"contractID": "16156", "source_chars": 8505, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 1, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 1, "Bad Randomness": 1, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 0}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 0, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 1, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 0}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.85, "Access Control": 0.75, "Arithmetic": 0.9, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.85, "DoS": 0.85, "Bad Randomness": 0.95, "Front Running": 0.5, "Time manipulation": 0.6}, "reasons": {"Arithmetic": "Solidity 0.4.12 with unchecked math: formatDecimals does `_value * 10**decimals`, and `balances[_addr] += tokens`, `balances[msg.sender] += tokens`, `tokens + tokenRaised`, and StandardToken's `balances[_to] += _value` bypass SafeMath, allowing overflow; burn() also deducts the balance twice.", "Unchecked Return Values": "burn() invokes transfer(0x0,_value) and discards its boolean return, so a silently failing transfer leaves state inconsistent after the balance was already decremented.", "Front Running": "approve() overwrites the allowance directly (classic ERC20 approval race), and owner calls to setTokenExchangeRate/startFunding can be front-run by buyers hitting the payable fallback."}, "agreement": 3, "wall_seconds": 25.22, "cli_duration_ms": 23263, "api_duration_ms": 23206, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 1821, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5384, "cache_read_input_tokens": 7383, "total_tokens": 14592}, "cost_usd": 0.10307649999999999, "num_turns": 3, "session_id": "5ac9db1d-80cd-449f-839c-e37bbe880ebf"}, {"contractID": "16457", "source_chars": 13580, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 1, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 1}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 0, "Unchecked Return Values": 1, "DoS": 1, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 1}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.25, "Access Control": 0.5, "Arithmetic": 0.15, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.5, "DoS": 0.6, "Bad Randomness": 0.03, "Front Running": 0.75, "Time manipulation": 0.6}, "reasons": {"Access Control": "Owner can arbitrarily blacklist any address via setBots (permanently blocking its transfers) with no cap or timelock, and manualswap/manualsend are gated only by a hardcoded fee wallet.", "Unchecked Return Values": "The boolean return of IERC20(uniswapV2Pair).approve(address(uniswapV2Router), type(uint).max) in openTrading is ignored.", "DoS": "setBots lets the owner permanently block arbitrary holders' transfers, and the sell path calls swapTokensForEth(contractTokenBalance) unconditionally, which reverts on the router when the contract token balance is zero.", "Front Running": "swapExactTokensForETHSupportingFeeOnTransferTokens is called with amountOutMin = 0 and a block.timestamp deadline, allowing MEV sandwiching of every fee swap.", "Time manipulation": "Anti-bot cooldown (cooldown[to] < block.timestamp, +30 seconds) and swap deadlines depend on block.timestamp, which a miner/validator can nudge."}, "agreement": 3, "wall_seconds": 30.35, "cli_duration_ms": 28406, "api_duration_ms": 28352, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 2247, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 7728, "cache_read_input_tokens": 9447, "total_tokens": 19426}, "cost_usd": 0.1381985, "num_turns": 3, "session_id": "2b81a015-07a8-4ab4-aba6-33a2d0bdcb58"}, {"contractID": "16751", "source_chars": 11848, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 1, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 0, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 0}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 1, "Access Control": 0, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 1, "DoS": 1, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 0}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.5, "Access Control": 0.35, "Arithmetic": 0.55, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.5, "DoS": 0.6, "Bad Randomness": 0.95, "Front Running": 0.8, "Time manipulation": 0.25}, "reasons": {"Reentrancy": "_transfer performs external calls (router swap and raw ETH push via sendETHToFee) before updating _balances, so balance bookkeeping happens after untrusted control transfer.", "Arithmetic": "In the team-wallet branch `oramounts` is set to a tiny min(...) value while the recipient is credited the full `amount`, so the debit and credit no longer match and tokens are effectively created out of thin air; tax math also truncates with div(100).", "Unchecked Return Values": "The bool return of IERC20(uniswapV2Pair).approve(router, max) in createOraPairs is ignored.", "DoS": "sendETHToFee pushes the whole contract ETH balance to the hard-coded team wallet with a 2300-gas transfer inside the sell path, so a rejecting/contract fee recipient reverts every taxed sell; withdrawStucksEth also relies on a push transfer.", "Front Running": "swapTokensForEth calls the router with amountOutMin = 0 and a block.timestamp deadline, allowing MEV sandwiching of every tax swap; buy-tax tiers/limit removal are also observable and order-dependent."}, "agreement": 3, "wall_seconds": 26.57, "cli_duration_ms": 24695, "api_duration_ms": 24652, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 1808, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5236, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1690, "total_tokens": 8736}, "cost_usd": 0.098415, "num_turns": 2, "session_id": "afd896e5-8608-4dab-97ce-70b2debda81a"}, {"contractID": "17113", "source_chars": 23342, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 1, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 1, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 0}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 0, "Arithmetic": 0, "Unchecked Return Values": 1, "DoS": 1, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 0}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.2, "Access Control": 0.25, "Arithmetic": 0.15, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.55, "DoS": 0.45, "Bad Randomness": 0.03, "Front Running": 0.8, "Time manipulation": 0.1}, "reasons": {"Unchecked Return Values": "claimETHOverflow performs a low-level call and only emits an event inside `if (success)`, silently swallowing a failed ETH transfer instead of reverting.", "DoS": "_swapAndTransfer push-pays ETH via Address.sendValue to the owner-set targetAWallet (reverts if it rejects) and the uint8 sum `_totalFee = a+b+c` reverts on overflow under 0.8.x, so a misconfigured/hostile fee wallet or fee setting bricks all taxed transfers.", "Front Running": "Both internal swaps use amountOutMin = 1 (accept any amount), letting MEV bots sandwich the contract's fee swaps and extract value."}, "agreement": 3, "wall_seconds": 17.3, "cli_duration_ms": 15409, "api_duration_ms": 15364, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 1183, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 10004, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1690, "total_tokens": 12879}, "cost_usd": 0.13047, "num_turns": 2, "session_id": "111f0363-0fb4-4365-b24b-6909a266e3a8"}, {"contractID": "17537", "source_chars": 13128, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 1, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 1}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 0, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 1, "Time manipulation": 1}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.2, "Access Control": 0.25, "Arithmetic": 0.6, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.15, "DoS": 0.3, "Bad Randomness": 0.03, "Front Running": 0.55, "Time manipulation": 0.7}, "reasons": {"Arithmetic": "Presale.buyTokens updates `purchasedTokens[beneficiary] += tokens;` and `receivedFunds[msg.sender] += weiAmountConsumed;` with raw (non-SafeMath) additions under Solidity 0.4.x, and `weiAmount.div(rate())` truncates while `rate()` can return 0 causing a division revert.", "Front Running": "ERC20 `approve` overwrites allowance without the zero-first pattern (classic approve race), and purchases near the hard `tokenCap` can be front-run since the last buyer's amount is truncated to the remaining cap.", "Time manipulation": "Both `rate()` (weekly discount tiers) and `getState()` (PreFunding/Funding/Refunding transitions) branch on `block.timestamp`, so a miner can nudge the timestamp around a tier or phase boundary for a better price or state."}, "agreement": 5, "wall_seconds": 26.92, "cli_duration_ms": 25044, "api_duration_ms": 24978, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 1880, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5703, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1690, "total_tokens": 9275}, "cost_usd": 0.104885, "num_turns": 2, "session_id": "0598dfed-d3f3-4b53-855e-80f14a2651e1"}, {"contractID": "18565", "source_chars": 5671, "truncated": false, "ground_truth": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 1, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 0, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 0}, "prediction": {"Reentrancy": 0, "Access Control": 1, "Arithmetic": 0, "Unchecked Return Values": 0, "DoS": 1, "Bad Randomness": 0, "Front Running": 0, "Time manipulation": 0}, "confidence": {"Reentrancy": 0.95, "Access Control": 0.88, "Arithmetic": 0.35, "Unchecked Return Values": 0.95, "DoS": 0.8, "Bad Randomness": 0.97, "Front Running": 0.25, "Time manipulation": 0.97}, "reasons": {"Access Control": "`removeLimits()` is an obfuscated backdoor letting the `_taxData` address mint a huge balance to itself without touching totalSupply, and `addBots` is `public` with its authorization `require` placed after the state write.", "DoS": "The blacklist branch in `_transfer` sets `amount = balance + buyCount`, which always fails the balance check, permanently freezing any address `_taxData` flags via `addBots`."}, "agreement": 6, "wall_seconds": 24.46, "cli_duration_ms": 22567, "api_duration_ms": 22514, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 1590, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3977, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6078, "total_tokens": 11649}, "cost_usd": 0.08257899999999999,